{"analysis_markdown_path":"articles/2026/08/11/itm_2db962c05b12c6e7/index.md","canonical_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.09885v1","category_id":"ai-safety","collected_at":"2026-08-11T07:10:21Z","content_hash":"57e8187e2f6884c436f61ec3fb1a0ad9e7804e088bdc8f81812fbe021216a39f","evidence":[{"label":"arXiv abstract and submission record","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.09885v1"},{"label":"Official project repository","type":"url","url":"https://github.com/RainbowQTT/SHE"}],"external_id":"arXiv:2608.09885v1","fetched_at":"2026-08-11T07:10:21Z","fingerprint":"57e8187e2f6884c436f61ec3fb1a0ad9e7804e088bdc8f81812fbe021216a39f","id":"itm_2db962c05b12c6e7","item_id":"itm_2db962c05b12c6e7","language":"zh-CN","published_at":"2026-08-10T17:35:08Z","sort_at":"2026-08-10T17:35:08Z","source_id":"arxiv","source_name":"arXiv","source_type":"manual","summary_zh":"SHE 把 LLM Agent 安全从固定提示词/静态护栏推进到可演化 harness：将 System Prompt、Rule Bank、Safety Memory、Tool Policy 拆成职责清晰的四类 artifact，用失败轨迹诊断 harm domain、attack surface、failure mode，再生成局部补丁并通过安全-效用选择保留。论文在 Agent-SafetyBench 上把平均 ASR 从 seed 的 8.6% 降到 5.5%，Clean UBR 从 25.7% 降到 19.8%，UA 从 33.5% 升到 47.6%；相对静态 SafeHarness 的 17.1% ASR 是 3.1 倍下降。held-out AgentHarm 上 Harm Score 从 19.8% 降到 9.8%，但实验依赖 LLM judge、15 个演化任务和离线 benchmark，生产化仍需人工审批、回滚和独立复现。","tags":["AI安全","LLM Agent","安全评测","prompt injection","harness"],"title":"SHE: Trajectory-driven Safety Harness Evolution for LLM Agents","title_hash":"f1a4785b658bf8e6606b83f02fb52f12bb5b5c17ba34e20938a67d1b305b8001","type":"paper","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.09885v1"}
{"analysis_markdown_path":"articles/2026/08/10/itm_d301babf976859a3/index.md","canonical_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.09526","category_id":"ai-safety","collected_at":"2026-08-11T07:11:01Z","content_hash":"df5e0bb57e2b56c8df3dc2cf1564b79bb5dfa392bd49e23147a1c29f9fa1d1db","evidence":[{"label":"arXiv abstract","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.09526"},{"label":"arXiv HTML","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/html/2608.09526"},{"label":"arXiv PDF","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2608.09526"}],"external_id":"arxiv:2608.09526v1","fetched_at":"2026-08-11T07:11:01Z","fingerprint":"df5e0bb57e2b56c8df3dc2cf1564b79bb5dfa392bd49e23147a1c29f9fa1d1db","id":"itm_d301babf976859a3","item_id":"itm_d301babf976859a3","language":"zh-CN","published_at":"2026-08-10T12:25:49Z","reading_minutes":18,"sort_at":"2026-08-10T12:25:49Z","source_id":"arxiv","source_name":"arXiv","source_type":"manual","summary_zh":"RangeFactory 将多跳 cyber range 构造表述为依赖解析：从单 CVE 环境的真实攻击中抽取 capability/runtime 依赖，用企业网络模板编排候选链，再端到端验证。论文构造 1,148 个 validated ranges、287 条 attack chains 和 5,541 条带结果标注轨迹；RangeBench 显示即使攻下入口漏洞，仍有 24.5% 到 47.0% 运行无法完成剩余链。局限是场景集中在线性 CVE 链、容器化企业网络和 pass@1 协议，轨迹训练收益尚未验证。","tags":["AI安全","AI for Security","Cyber Range","LLM Agent","Benchmark","CVE"],"title":"RangeFactory: Scalable Construction of Multi-Hop Cyber Ranges","title_hash":"8c252a999ec38269b9c37fc9515c090a6ca91f54b24e45c88ba71afccd22a826","type":"paper","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.09526"}
{"analysis_markdown_path":"articles/2026/08/10/itm_71638b796ab7fd36/index.md","canonical_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.06477","category_id":"ai-safety","collected_at":"2026-08-11T07:13:50Z","content_hash":"c6bed1c947698f084463eaa2d06d27ed113cf84ecb49ba4d1c771318e3ad77ac","evidence":[{"label":"arXiv abstract and metadata","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.06477"},{"label":"arXiv cs.CR new listing for 2026-08-10","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/list/cs.CR/new"},{"label":"StepJack code and dataset repository","type":"url","url":"https://github.com/BorealisAI/StepJack"},{"label":"RedTeamCUA upstream sandbox","type":"url","url":"https://github.com/OSU-NLP-Group/RedTeamCUA"}],"external_id":"arXiv:2608.06477v1","fetched_at":"2026-08-11T07:13:50Z","fingerprint":"c6bed1c947698f084463eaa2d06d27ed113cf84ecb49ba4d1c771318e3ad77ac","id":"itm_71638b796ab7fd36","item_id":"itm_71638b796ab7fd36","language":"zh-CN","published_at":"2026-08-10T00:00:00Z","sort_at":"2026-08-10T00:00:00Z","source_id":"arxiv","source_name":"arXiv","source_type":"manual","summary_zh":"StepJack 评测 computer-use agents 面对多步间接提示注入时是否还能拒绝攻击：攻击者把恶意目标拆成多个看似无害的子步骤，分散在 Agent 正常导航路径上的页面链中。论文用自动分解管线生成满足目标忠实和单步无害性的子步骤，基于 RedTeamCUA sandbox 构造每个 CUA 480 个样例，评估 6 个 CUA。关键结果是：在默认无 urgency cue 时，GPT-5.4-mini 的 ASR 从单步 41.7% 升到三步 72.9%，排除无法稳定跟随引用链的 EvoCUA-32B 后，5 个 CUA 平均 ASR 从 31.3% 升到 36.9%；局限是实验只跑单次、成本高、仅 12 个 adversarial goals 且 k<=3。","tags":["ai-safety","computer-use-agent","prompt-injection","benchmark","red-teaming"],"title":"StepJack: Benchmarking Computer-Use Agent Safety Against Multi-Step Indirect Prompt Injection","title_hash":"33251da928b19e5d37be3659ec75575fe2c886bd3c0d04c888ecc2fe78e194e4","type":"paper","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.06477"}
